{"text": "State of New Mexico\nFlexible Spending Accounts\nEnrollment Agreement: CALENDAR Year 2012\n\n| wish to have my salary reduced from the first day of January through December 31, 2012 in each\nof the categories as follows. | understand the benefits available to me as well as the other rights\nand obligations that | have under the Plan. | understand that during the above period this\nagreement is irrevocable and cannot be changed except under special circumstances as outlined in the State of New\nMexico Flexible Spending Account Program. This agreement is subject to the terms of the State of New Mexico Flexible\nSpending Account Program, Medical FSA and/or Dependent Care FSA, and revokes any prior election under these plans.\n\nName - -\nSocial Security Number\nStreet\nCity Pay Branch/Agency\nState, Zip\n\nFlexible Spending Accounts\nEnrollment in both categories in this section will terminate at the end of each CALENDAR year unless you re-enroll for the\nfollowing year.\nTotal ANNUAL Deduction\n\nMedical FSA $_.,\n(Excluding insurance premiums)\nNot to exceed $5,000\n\nDependent Care FSA $_.,\nAdult/child care that enables you to work\nNot to exceed $5,000 per family\n\nYour annual amount will be divided equally out of your paychecks in the calendar year. Your salary will be reduced each\npaycheck by that amount.\n\nChoose one:\n4 DIRECT DEPOSIT: | authorize ASI to credit my account number with\n\n; with my Medical\n(name of bank) (routing number)\nand/or Dependent Care FSA claim reimbursements. This account is a @ checking \u201c* savings \u2014\u00a7 money market\naccount. | have attached a copy of a voided check.\n\n4 Please send me notice of each direct deposit and quarterly statements to the email address below.\n\nEmail address\n\n} CHECK: | wish to have a check mailed to me for my Medical FSA and/or my Dependent Care FSA payments instead\nof direct deposit.\n\n| hereby authorize and direct my employer to reduce my salary in the amount necessary to pay for the coverage shown above in accordance with the\nState of New Mexico Flex ble Spending Account Plan, Section 125. Such reductions, considered as elective contributions under the plan, shall\ncommence within the payroll cycle in which this election is received by my payroll center. | understand that any amounts remaining in my account(s)\nnot used for eligible expenses incurred during my coverage period will be forfeited in accordance with current plan provisions and tax laws.\n\nEmployee's signature: Date\n\nReturn this form to your group representative.\n\nNM-EF(10/12)",
